            "notes": "round 2, these two items are EXTREMELY important and you will be keeping them until the end of the game. trust me, its worth it to keep these\n\nif you have enough, grab  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and  [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d). if you dont have enough, selling one of the common powers is okay as theyre 1,500 each\nthis will boost your tokki slam damage like crazy, and will the recent buff to it, youll be farming ur ult fast!\n\nheres a 30 sec vid of it (this is later in the game, but i promise you can still farm your ult fast in round 2 just like this)\n[YouTube Video](https://youtube.com/embed/dxE9T0Y4vLU)",
