            "notes": "i like to grab  [Express Detonation](item_8da4cbad-78cb-4ebd-8bc4-8dc150afec95) this round as youll already be farming your ult pretty fast, this just helps for more survivability and possible kills\n\nfor items, if you have enough for it, grab  [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c). if not, any of the rare survival items that give shields or armor can work. i personally take  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) / [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) , or  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) if theres anyone who can stun you (rein, cass, ana, sigma), or an annoying ashe with a dynamite build",
